# GTT: in-mission radio and hint lines, from the GTT pools of SLOT.DAT
# (ANALYSIS/11).  Rules for every entry here:
#   - the block is re-laid-out when it is written back, so a translation may be
#     LONGER than the English line -- it can grow into the bytes the suffix-merged
#     fragments used to occupy.  `budget N B` is this line's share of that slack
#     (English length + slack/n), and `po_lint` fails the build with
#     `gtt-budget` when it is exceeded;
#   - the game stores a line break as a two-character `\n`, so keep the same
#     number of lines as the source.


#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x0 (id 0x85, record 0), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x0/0
msgid "OK, you're done with that area. Head for the goal."
msgstr "好，这片区域搞定了。前往目标点。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x90 (id 0x78, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x90/0
msgid "Head for the recovery zone. We'll pick you up there."
msgstr "前往回收区，我们在那接你。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x110 (id 0x8e, record 0), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x110/0
msgid "I see you completed your mission. Now hurry to the recovery point."
msgstr "任务完成了。快去回收点。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1a0 (id 0xa7, record 0), budget 64 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1a0/0
msgid "Now you just have to make it to the goal point..."
msgstr "现在只需抵达目标点……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1a0 (id 0xa7, record 0), budget 34 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1a0/1
msgid "Keep your guard up."
msgstr "保持警惕。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x250 (id 0x6f, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x250/0
msgid "Now simply make your way to the recovery zone."
msgstr "现在直接前往回收区。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x2c0 (id 0x80, record 0), budget 71 B
#. GTT pool 0x1c7af20b block 0x2f0 (id 0x80, record 102), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x2c0/0
#: gtt/0x1c7af20b/0x2f0/0
msgid ""
"Stay out of sight 'til they've called off\n"
"the alert."
msgstr ""
"躲好，等他们解除\n"
"警报。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x340 (id 0xdb, record 0), budget 69 B
#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7100 (id 0xdb, record 0), budget 69 B
#. GTT pool 0x1c7af24b block 0x380 (id 0xdb, record 156), budget 69 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x340/0
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7100/0
#: gtt/0x1c7af24b/0x380/0
msgid "To neutralize an enemy, put him to sleep, knock him out,"
msgstr "要制伏敌人，可让他睡着、打晕，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x340 (id 0xdb, record 0), budget 76 B
#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x7100 (id 0xdb, record 0), budget 76 B
#. GTT pool 0x1c7af24b block 0x380 (id 0xdb, record 156), budget 76 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x340/1
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x7100/1
#: gtt/0x1c7af24b/0x380/1
msgid "or leave him in a near-death state - whatever floats your boat."
msgstr "或留他半死不活——随你高兴。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x420 (id 0x9c, record 0), budget 103 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x420/0
msgid "Still can't find them? Have you tried using a night vision device?"
msgstr "还找不到？试试夜视仪？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x4c0 (id 0x4f, record 0), budget 23 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x4c0/0
msgid "Bravo! Nice work!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x510 (id 0x64, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x510/0
msgid "Now that's what I'm talkin' about! Amazing!"
msgstr "这才像样！太棒了！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x580 (id 0x5a, record 0), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x580/0
msgid "That's the way! Keep it up!"
msgstr "就这样！继续！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x5e0 (id 0x7e, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x5e0/0
msgid "Mission complete! The folks back at Mother Base will be thrilled."
msgstr "任务完成！母基地的人会乐坏的。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x660 (id 0x5f, record 0), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x660/0
msgid "You did it! Keep it up!"
msgstr "成功了！继续！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x6c0 (id 0x77, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x6c0/0
msgid "I knew you could do it. Piece of cake, right?"
msgstr "我就知道你能行。小菜一碟吧？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x740 (id 0x5e, record 0), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x740/0
msgid "Mission complete! Great job."
msgstr "任务完成！干得好。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x7a0 (id 0x63, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x7a0/0
msgid "Good job! Return to base."
msgstr "干得好！回基地。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x810 (id 0x8f, record 0), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x810/0
msgid "Hey, that was great! Can't wait to see what else you can do."
msgstr "嘿，太棒了！期待你更多表现。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x8a0 (id 0x66, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x8a0/0
msgid "Hello! Come in! Can you hear me?"
msgstr "喂！回话！能听到吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x910 (id 0x6a, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x910/0
msgid "I don't like this... Be careful."
msgstr "我有不祥预感，小心。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x980 (id 0x5d, record 0), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x980/0
msgid "What the hell's going on out there?!"
msgstr "外面到底出什么事了？！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xa20 (id 0x59, record 0), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xa20/0
msgid "Come in! Do you copy?"
msgstr "回话！收到吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xa80 (id 0x87, record 0), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xa80/0
msgid "Be careful, if my info is correct, you're right next to a...!"
msgstr "小心，若情报没错，你旁边就是……！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xb10 (id 0x65, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xb10/0
msgid "Oh man, there's something out there!"
msgstr "天哪，外面有东西！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xb80 (id 0x4b, record 0), budget 23 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xb80/0
msgid "This is The End."
msgstr "我是终焉。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xbd0 (id 0x61, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xbd0/0
msgid "What's wrong?! I'm right here!"
msgstr "怎么了？！我就在这！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xc40 (id 0x80, record 0), budget 20 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xc40/0
msgid "I will find you!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xc40 (id 0x80, record 0), budget 29 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xc40/1
msgid "There's no place to hide."
msgstr "你无处可藏。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xcc0 (id 0x65, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xcc0/0
msgid "I can feel it! I can feel your presence!"
msgstr "我能感觉到！你的存在！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xd30 (id 0x6e, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xd30/0
msgid "I am the forest and I am watching over you."
msgstr "我就是森林，我注视着你。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xda0 (id 0x5a, record 0), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xda0/0
msgid "What's up? An enemy?"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xe00 (id 0x7c, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xe00/0
msgid "You see anything? A UMA, maybe?!"
msgstr "看到啥了？未知生物？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xe80 (id 0x7a, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xe80/0
msgid "You did well. They'll finally be able to rest in peace!"
msgstr "干得好。他们终于能安息了！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xf00 (id 0xb0, record 0), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xf00/0
msgid "That went well."
msgstr "干得漂亮。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xf00 (id 0xb0, record 0), budget 62 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xf00/1
msgid "Now come on back before you get possessed."
msgstr "快回来，别被附身了。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0xfb0 (id 0x83, record 0), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0xfb0/0
msgid "Looks like the wandering spirits heard you somehow."
msgstr "看来游魂不知怎么听到了你。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1040 (id 0x84, record 0), budget 20 B
#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x4be0 (id 0xa1, record 0), budget 26 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1040/0
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x4be0/0
msgid "Good job."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1040 (id 0x84, record 0), budget 46 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1040/1
msgid "Rest in peace, wandering spirits..."
msgstr "安息吧，游魂……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x10d0 (id 0x9b, record 0), budget 34 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x10d0/0
msgid "Where would a ghost hang out?"
msgstr "鬼魂会藏在哪呢？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x10d0 (id 0x9b, record 0), budget 47 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x10d0/1
msgid "Sorry. I'm clueless at that kind of stuff."
msgstr "抱歉，这种事我一窍不通。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1170 (id 0x68, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1170/0
msgid "Let your sixth sense guide you."
msgstr "用你的第六感带路吧。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x11e0 (id 0x7a, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x11e0/0
msgid "The Surround Indicator is picking up a ghostly presence."
msgstr "环绕指示器探测到幽灵气息。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1260 (id 0x77, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1260/0
msgid "Just out of curiosity...do ghosts have legs or what?"
msgstr "纯属好奇……鬼有腿吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x12e0 (id 0x63, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x12e0/0
msgid "You're not scared or anything...? Wow..."
msgstr "你不害怕吗……？厉害……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1350 (id 0x6b, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1350/0
msgid "Los fantasmas really exist after all, eh?"
msgstr "幽灵原来真的存在啊？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x13c0 (id 0x8d, record 0), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x13c0/0
msgid "Hurry and get a picture of a fantasma. I'm dying to see one."
msgstr "快去拍张幽灵的照片，我超想看。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1450 (id 0x73, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1450/0
msgid "Wow, you got one? Hurry back!"
msgstr "哇，拍到了？快回！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x14d0 (id 0x7a, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x14d0/0
msgid "A photo of a ghost? It's gotta be some kind of hoax."
msgstr "幽灵照片？肯定是骗人的。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1550 (id 0xd8, record 0), budget 64 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1550/0
msgid "Ghosts? I have no inerest in such things."
msgstr "鬼魂？我对那种东西没兴趣。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1550 (id 0xd8, record 0), budget 82 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1550/1
msgid "Harpies, on the other hand, I wouldn't mind encountering..."
msgstr "不过鹰身女妖，我倒想见见……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1630 (id 0xa3, record 0), budget 46 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1630/0
msgid "There are NO such things as ghosts."
msgstr "鬼魂根本不存在。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1630 (id 0xa3, record 0), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1630/1
msgid "Like they'd really show up in a photo..."
msgstr "它们怎会出现在照片里……"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x16e0 (id 0x6c, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x16e0/0
msgid "The ghost is... gone?! What'd you do?"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1750 (id 0x94, record 0), budget 103 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1750/0
msgid "It looks like those ghosts can't stray too far from the dying soldiers."
msgstr "看来那些幽灵离不开濒死的士兵。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x17f0 (id 0x7a, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x17f0/0
msgid "Your comrades need first aid! Give 'em CPR!"
msgstr "战友要急救！快做心肺复苏！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1870 (id 0x85, record 0), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1870/0
msgid "Your fellow MSF members need your help! Give them CPR!"
msgstr "MSF同伴需要帮助！快做心肺复苏！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1900 (id 0x91, record 0), budget 51 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1900/0
msgid "Don't just stand there, save them!"
msgstr "别愣着，救他们！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1900 (id 0x91, record 0), budget 31 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1900/1
msgid "Give them CPR!"
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x19a0 (id 0xbe, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x19a0/0
msgid "The ghost was sucked into that soldier's body...?"
msgstr "幽灵被吸进那士兵身体了……？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x19a0 (id 0xbe, record 0), budget 59 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x19a0/1
msgid "Whoa! You think that's what brought him back to life?"
msgstr "哇！你觉得这就是他复活的原因？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1a60 (id 0xba, record 0), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1a60/0
msgid "So saving the soldier's life"
msgstr "所以救了那士兵的命"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1a60 (id 0xba, record 0), budget 66 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1a60/1
msgid "caused his spirit to reunite with his body...?"
msgstr "让他灵魂与身体合一了……？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1b20 (id 0x85, record 0), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1b20/0
msgid "Damn it, the ghost's been set loose! It's coming after you! RUN!"
msgstr "该死，幽灵被放出来了！它冲你来了！快跑！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1bb0 (id 0xb1, record 0), budget 48 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1bb0/0
msgid "Whoa, this is freaky!"
msgstr "哇，太诡异了！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1bb0 (id 0xb1, record 0), budget 66 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1bb0/1
msgid "What'd you do to make the ghost so mad?"
msgstr "你做了什么让幽灵这么火大？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1c70 (id 0xa0, record 0), budget 103 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1c70/0
msgid "Night vision devices are good for locating prisoners in the dark. Hurry!"
msgstr "夜视仪能在黑暗中找到俘虏。快！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1d10 (id 0x72, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1d10/0
msgid "To the cell on the double! Your buddy needs you!"
msgstr "火速赶往牢房！你的同伴需要你！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1d90 (id 0x7e, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1d90/0
msgid "Your friend's moving fast! Hang in there until he gets there!"
msgstr "你朋友跑得很快！撑住等他到！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1e10 (id 0x7b, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1e10/0
msgid "Hurry up - your pal's stamina won't hold out much longer!"
msgstr "快点——你同伴的体力撑不了多久了！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1e90 (id 0x88, record 0), budget 87 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1e90/0
msgid "Time's up. We... We weren't able to save him. Return to base."
msgstr "时间到。我们……没能救下他。返回基地。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1f20 (id 0xa7, record 0), budget 63 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1f20/0
msgid "Never mind, it's too late. Your buddy... He's dead."
msgstr "算了，太迟了。你的同伴……他死了。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1f20 (id 0xa7, record 0), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1f20/1
msgid "The mission has failed."
msgstr "任务失败。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1fd0 (id 0xc1, record 0), budget 83 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1fd0/0
msgid "Look for an enemy soldier who's not acting like the others."
msgstr "找出行为与众不同的敌兵。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x1fd0 (id 0xc1, record 0), budget 47 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x1fd0/1
msgid "That'll be your target."
msgstr "那就是你目标。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x20a0 (id 0x69, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x20a0/0
msgid "The one that's acting weird. Got it?"
msgstr "那个举止怪异的。明白吗？"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x2110 (id 0x73, record 0), budget 71 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x2110/0
msgid "Stop the enemy in their tracks! Don't let them through!"
msgstr "拦住敌人！别让他们过去！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x2190 (id 0x5e, record 0), budget 39 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x2190/0
msgid "Please make it in time..."
msgstr "请务必及时赶到…"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x21f0 (id 0xd8, record 0), budget 40 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x21f0/0
msgid "It doesn't matter where he's from,"
msgstr "不管他来自哪里，"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x21f0 (id 0xd8, record 0), budget 54 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x21f0/1
msgid "we cannot allow prisoner abuse to go unanswered."
msgstr "我们绝不容忍虐待俘虏。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x21f0 (id 0xd8, record 0), budget 29 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x21f0/2
msgid "You have to rescue him."
msgstr "你必须救出他。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x22d0 (id 0xb5, record 0), budget 86 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x22d0/0
msgid "Leaving prisoners out in the open like that smells like a trap to me."
msgstr "把囚犯晾在外面，我看像陷阱。"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x22d0 (id 0xb5, record 0), budget 28 B
#. GTT pool 0x1c767903 block 0x37c0 (id 0xc7, record 0), budget 35 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x22d0/1
#: gtt/0x1c767903/0x37c0/1
msgid "Be careful."
msgstr ""

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x2390 (id 0x61, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x2390/0
msgid "There's no time! Hurry!"
msgstr "没时间了！快！"

#. GTT pool 0x1c0fb1c9 block 0x2400 (id 0x6b, record 0), budget 55 B
#: gtt/0x1c0fb1c9/0x2400/0
